note contract 6 line 171 with OMEGESE 9.5: write keeps its slice check on an unsized view:
note off 9, n 4 on len 10 traps 3 before the call (exit 103, no stdout).
om2
fn g v view uchar * to void
w = write 1 v 9 4
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 65
g a
ret 0
end
